 note:'Mountain valley communes sworn against Habsburg lordship in the Eternal Alliance of 1291; their pike squares destroyed feudal cavalry at Morgarten and Sempach and made “Swiss” a byword for infantry. De facto independent from 1499, recognised at Westphalia in 1648, a federal state from 1848.',
